  (text "FRONT PANEL - 4 layers, 180 x 100 mm; outer copper = AGND, In1.Cu = AGND plane, In2.Cu = GND plane, joined to GND only at the main-board star point NT1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 11.27 8.73 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "db2be87c-6d62-5348-9817-d83f5a8f7f1a"))
  (rectangle (start 600 14) (end 837 200) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "73e47877-802f-5f9b-9303-2c152b3e1451"))
  (text "MODULE HEADER - eight 5 V TTL outputs for an off-board relay / H-bridge module" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 601.27 12.73 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f89276f-9e2e-5abc-ab4d-2130831fa25f"))
  (rectangle (start 600 210) (end 837 560) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "14f6eed9-94c4-5e21-b41a-acf294e3f09d"))
  (text "ISOLATED INPUTS - 6N137 channels moved to the panel; ISO_IN net class, 2.5 mm to everything else" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 601.27 208.73 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1c83c8ca-cb09-5fef-b3ea-94a6ac41e0f1"))
  (text "The panel lies FLAT ON THE BACK of the main board (Decision #45). J1 / J2 / J3 are 2x20 FEMALE headers on the panel's INNER face (B.Cu); they mate J6 / J7 / J8, the male headers on the main board's bottom side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b4afd2e8-d97b-5fea-aa56-40a576d44ce8"))
  (text "Panel coordinates are mirrored in x against the main board (panel x = 180 - main x, panel y = main y), because the panel is drawn from its OUTER face. The main board's REAR edge is therefore the panel's TOP edge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "31b85183-7e7e-548e-9438-4b788a72e349"))
  (text "With that mirror, panel pad k mates main-board pin k on all three headers (the KiCad PinSocket footprint already carries the mating mirror). gen_panel.py proves it from the pad coordinates before the board is written." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bec9dbab-5f99-5b4c-8800-6804ba4c96d7"))
  (text "So the analog header J6 (main x = 12) is panel J1 at panel x = 168, the digital header J7 stays at x = 90, and the power header J8 (main x = 168) is panel J3 at panel x = 12." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 29 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb8ac7a5-fefa-5c56-9ccd-9844693640b9"))
  (text "Pins marked spare are not connected on the main board and are left unconnected here. SPARE (the 18th SMA position is empty; the fitted SPARE SMA) has its shield on AGND and its centre pin on TP1 only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5f862bc3-8f6e-5ce5-b4a2-3325e3cb2ae4"))
  (text "J30 is one footprint: the vertical 8.5 mm 1x4 socket (JLC C2894927) plus the OLED module's outline and its four M2 (2.2 mm) holes. The module lies flat on four 11 mm M2 stand-offs; measure the real module's hole spacing (23.5 x 23.8 assumed) before the order." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 37 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c62758d3-e84f-5b87-b505-310e7e4e16c5"))
  (text "AO1/AO2: +-10 V, 49.9 ohm back-terminated. AI1..AI8: +-10 V, 1 kohm series on the main board. TRIG: 5 V into open circuit, about 2.4 V into 50 ohm. FAST1/FAST2 = the main-board nets FASTTTL1 / FASTTTL2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 41 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1248ceb7-e9a2-5ffb-96a6-539bf18721a1"))
  (text "J1 - analog (inner face): mates J6, the analog header" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "24b331e9-ccff-5772-9911-5c2bbcbfd942"))
  (text "panel x = 168 mm (main board x = 12 mm)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45 104 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5bcc8ab-80bd-559a-b666-54a8dfbadb0e"))
  (text "J2 - digital (inner face): mates J7, the digital header" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "648bef96-79c9-5d8a-8b1f-c777feb61524"))
  (text "panel x = 90 mm (main board x = 90 mm)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215 104 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e07cdd75-6d92-559e-87fb-78d2c8bcbd7a"))
  (text "J3 - power + spares (inner face): mates J8, the power + spares header" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 385 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dfb76934-2bd6-55ed-b385-00c2728eb5b8"))
  (text "panel x = 12 mm (main board x = 168 mm)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 385 104 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7e51dabc-814f-59f5-bcab-6266c06ecbb6"))
  (text "17 SMA on a 20 mm grid (3 x 6, the 18th position is empty). Shields on AGND; the panel copper is AGND on both layers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 196 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a407bc72-a3f4-5aa9-b0b4-2d59528454f7"))
